<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman downgrades Barclays.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Goldman downgrades Barclays.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs said on Wednesday it had cut its rating for Barclays Plc to &quot;market performer&quot; from &quot;market outperformer&quot;.</p>
<p>Barclays announced its annual results on Tuesday. Profits were lower than most analysts had forecast and the banking group's shares tumbled.</p>
<p>The shares were down 17-1/2p at 11.115 stg by 1224 GMT on Wednesday following a 70p fall on Tuesday.</p>
<p>London newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
